    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Can a simple piece of paper hold something very heavy? A 14-year-old boy named Miles Wu has "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "proved",
            "ref": "v-prove"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " that it can!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Miles has loved origami (the art of "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "folding",
            "ref": "v-fold"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " paper) since he was eight. He loves making paper birds and insects. He even sold some of his works to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "raise money for charity",
            "ref": "v-raise-money-for-charity"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Last year, Miles entered a big science "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "contest",
            "zh": "竞赛"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". He used a special way of folding paper called the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Miura-Ori fold",
            "zh": "三浦折叠法"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". This fold lets a large map open and close in one easy move. "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "NASA",
            "zh": "美国国家航空航天局"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " uses this same idea to open "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "solar panels",
            "ref": "v-solar-panel"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "satellites",
            "zh": "卫星"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in space."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Miles wanted to use these folds to help people. He thought they could make strong "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "shelters"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for people who lose their homes. He set up a simple “lab” in his living room, and tested 54 different ways to fold paper."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Finally, he discovered one way of folding the paper that could support more than 10,000 times its own weight! Miles said this was like "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "piling",
            "ref": "v-pile"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " 4,000 elephants on top of a taxi. The judges loved his project. Miles won first prize and $25,000."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Miles wants to keep exploring. “It is always worth following your "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "curiosity",
            "ref": "v-curiosity"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ",” he said, “because you don’t know where it could lead you.”"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
